item.description:
Introduce   &ldquo;Cobalt Strike is threat emulation software. Execute targeted attacks against modern enterprises with one of the most powerful network attack kits available to penetration testers. This is not compliance testing.&rdquo;
  If you&rsquo;ve ever used Cobalt Strike, you probably know that Cobalt Strike doesn&rsquo;t support remote control of Linux, MacOS, Android&hellip; by default.
  CrossC2 is an extension plugin that lets Cobalt Strike remotely control Linux, MacOS, Android&hellip; servers.
